# collision_demo.suite
# Visual showcase — three mid-air off-centre collisions in sequence.
# Each scene runs for 7.5s (900 fixed physics steps at 120Hz) then auto-advances.
#
#   1. Ball vs Ball  — glancing blow, both balls spin after impact
#   2. Box vs Box    — off-centre hit, both boxes tumble after impact
#   3. Box vs Ball   — box clips top of ball, ball gets backspin, box tumbles
#
# Run: SKULLBONEZ_CORE.exe --suite SkullbonezData/scenes/collision_demo.suite
SkullbonezData/scenes/collision_demo_ball_ball.scene
SkullbonezData/scenes/collision_demo_box_box.scene
SkullbonezData/scenes/collision_demo_box_ball.scene
